{
    "version": "nightly",
    "description": "ToDesk 远程桌面（Scoop 解包；LocalAppData 联接 persist）",
    "homepage": "https://www.todesk.com/",
    "license": {
        "identifier": "Proprietary",
        "url": "https://www.todesk.com/licence.html"
    },
    "url": "https://dl.todesk.com/windows/ToDesk_Setup.exe#/dl.7z",
    "installer": {
        "script": "& ((Get-ChildItem (Join-Path $scoopdir 'buckets\\\\*\\\\bin\\\\hook.ps1') -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Select-Object -First 1).FullName) 'hooks/todesk/install.ps1'"
    },
    "uninstaller": {
        "script": "& ((Get-ChildItem (Join-Path $scoopdir 'buckets\\\\*\\\\bin\\\\hook.ps1') -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Select-Object -First 1).FullName) 'hooks/todesk/uninstall.ps1'"
    },
    "shortcuts": [
        [
            "ToDesk.exe",
            "ToDesk"
        ]
    ],
    "persist": [
        "Logs",
        "config.ini"
    ],
    "notes": [
        "Scoop 解压便携包，不主动注册 ToDesk_Service（与 dorado 一致；包内无独立服务安装器）。",
        "%LOCALAPPDATA%\\ToDesk → persist/LocalAppData；config.ini / Logs 由 Scoop persist。",
        "若本机已有 ToDesk_Service，卸载时需管理员 PowerShell 才能删掉。",
        "不强制安装/卸载 ToDeskAudio.sys；卸载后内核音频驱动可能残留。",
        "若已有 D:\\Program\\ToDesk\\config.ini，首次安装会迁入 persist。",
        "manifest 为 nightly（无 hash）；官网 CDN 可能同址换包，与 dorado todesk / steam 同策略。"
    ]
}
